---
import personalimage from '../../assets/gradphoto.jpg';
---

<div class="about-me-section">
  <h2>👤 About Me</h2>
  <p>
    I’m a recent Computer Science grad from CSUF who loves building software, but I've always had fascination with 
    airplanes, rockets, and the aerospace industry. My path into software engineering is a bit 
    unique, before jumping full-time into code, my background involved a mix of different jobs, including working 
    for nearly three years in a non-destructive testing facility handling actual aerospace components.
  </p>
  <p>
    Today, I love bringing those two worlds together, whether I'm hacking away on full-stack web platforms, working 
    with robotic manipulation systems, or building clean data pipelines, I focus on writing reliable code that seamlessly 
    bridges software with real-world applications.
  </p>


  <h3>🤝 Collaboration & Milestones</h3>
  <p>
    I thrive in fast-paced, collaborative environments. I recently engineered solutions for a 
    5-month industry-sponsored autonomous inspection system, culminating in a successful presentation 
    at the CSUF Engineering & Computer Science Innovation Expo. I specialize in taking a high-level 
    hardware challenge, collaborating with a core team, and delivering functional software pipelines.
  </p>

  <h3>🏋️ Outside the Code</h3>
  <p>Outside of computer science, my interests are quite diverse:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Hanging out with my wonderful girlfriend and friends</li>
    <li>Traveling</li>
    <li>Trying unique restaurants and ranking them</li>
    <li>Playing basketball and soccer</li>
    <li>Going on hikes</li>
    <li>Working out at the gym</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="image-container">
    <img class="main-img" src={personalimage.src} alt="Folder" />
  </div>


</div>

<style>
  .about-me-section ul {
    list-style-type: none;
    padding-left: 5px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .about-me-section li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .about-me-section li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 6px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0058e6 0%, #3a93ff 100%);
    border: 1px solid #003399;
    box-shadow: 1px 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  .image-container {
    max-width: 200px;
    height: 300px;  
    position: relative;
    margin: auto;
    border: 1px solid #000;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .main-img {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain; 
    z-index: 1;
  }
</style>